WEBVTT

00:00.910 --> 00:03.980
We have news from the scouts, Master.

00:03.980 --> 00:09.150
They've discovered abandoned ruins in the 
southern region of the Knight Kingdom of Lestia.

00:09.150 --> 00:10.630
Lestia...

00:10.630 --> 00:12.350
That's Hilde's country,

00:12.350 --> 00:15.460
but it might be faster to 
use Fly instead of Babylon.

00:15.460 --> 00:16.820
Touya.

00:17.620 --> 00:18.660
Huh?!

00:20.950 --> 00:24.270
U-Uh, why are you wearing those outfits?

00:24.270 --> 00:26.760
You like this sort of thing, don't you?

00:26.760 --> 00:29.980
They're the same as your first love, 
"Sister Shouko," right?

00:29.980 --> 00:30.870
Huh?!

00:30.870 --> 00:34.590
W-We might not be older women,

00:34.590 --> 00:37.010
but I thought we could 
at least wear the same outfit.

00:37.010 --> 00:38.740
Hey, hold on...

00:44.790 --> 00:48.400
Uh, wh-who told you about Sister Shouko?

00:48.400 --> 00:50.230
Sister-in-Law Karen.

00:50.230 --> 00:52.860
That stupid woman!

00:55.650 --> 00:56.940
Um...

00:57.320 --> 00:59.780
Do we not look good in them?

01:07.130 --> 01:09.130
No, you do look good.

01:09.130 --> 01:10.900
You're all super cute.

01:16.790 --> 01:20.870
Gather up your tears

01:20.870 --> 01:23.270
And release your unhindered light

01:23.270 --> 01:28.200
That shines like a diamond

01:28.200 --> 01:29.710
Don't worry, don't care

01:29.710 --> 01:32.750
Follow your heart

01:43.540 --> 01:49.800
Every time I spoke of my
dreams, they felt closed off

01:49.800 --> 01:56.110
Even that bird and that sky
seemed monochrome to me

01:56.110 --> 02:02.560
Yet you were there in my path,
your eyes brimming with strength

02:02.560 --> 02:09.240
Time then stopped, and deep within
my heart something began to stir

02:11.310 --> 02:15.320
Don't be afraid, and run forth

02:15.320 --> 02:17.690
If we only have one life to live

02:17.690 --> 02:24.000
Then be true to yourself,
so you don't regret it

02:24.000 --> 02:28.090
Gather up your tears

02:28.090 --> 02:30.470
And release your unhindered light

02:30.470 --> 02:35.490
That shines like a diamond

02:35.490 --> 02:36.960
Don't worry, don't care

02:36.960 --> 02:40.110
Follow your heart

02:46.020 --> 02:51.020
Episode 12

02:46.020 --> 02:51.020
Birth of a Prince and
With My Smartphone

03:06.840 --> 03:08.040
This is...

03:08.360 --> 03:09.640
the Tower?

03:09.640 --> 03:15.040
Welcome to Babylon's Tower, and my Rampart.

03:15.710 --> 03:20.780
I am the terminal administering 
the Rampart, Preliora.

03:20.780 --> 03:22.680
Please call me Liora.

03:22.680 --> 03:24.380
The Rampart?

03:24.380 --> 03:25.800
Not the Tower?

03:26.190 --> 03:29.630
347 years ago, my Rampart happened 
to make contact with the Tower

03:29.630 --> 03:33.020
and completed docking with it.

03:33.020 --> 03:37.000
This is now both the Tower and the Rampart.

03:39.050 --> 03:42.640
I understand you are someone 
who possesses all affinities.

03:42.640 --> 03:45.350
However, both the Tower and the Rampart

03:45.350 --> 03:48.470
can only be used by someone 
deemed compatible.

03:48.840 --> 03:51.200
I've already been acknowledged 
by the administrators

03:51.200 --> 03:54.040
of the Garden, the Workshop, 
the Alchemy Ward, and the Hangar.

03:54.040 --> 03:57.480
I see. Then there should be no issues.

03:57.480 --> 03:59.290
I shall acknowledge you as compatible.

03:59.290 --> 04:00.010
Huh?

04:00.490 --> 04:02.440
<i>Where's the usual affair?</i>

04:02.440 --> 04:05.140
<i>It seems kind of lacking without it.</i>

04:05.140 --> 04:08.110
<i>No, no, it's good that I don't have 
to go through those extra steps.</i>

04:08.110 --> 04:10.050
<i>Being normal is best.</i>

04:10.050 --> 04:13.940
As of this moment, Unit #20, 
code name "Preliora,"

04:13.940 --> 04:15.960
will be transferred to your command.

04:15.960 --> 04:18.440
I look forward to serving you, Master.

04:19.000 --> 04:21.860
I'll now lead you to the 
administrator of the Tower.

04:21.860 --> 04:23.340
This way, please.

04:31.410 --> 04:33.120
Her skirt...

04:33.120 --> 04:36.330
Please pay it no mind. 
She's always like that.

04:36.330 --> 04:38.120
No, I do mind!

04:39.070 --> 04:41.120
Anyway, please wake her.

04:41.120 --> 04:42.340
Of course.

04:43.870 --> 04:45.430
Noel, wake up.

04:45.430 --> 04:46.880
Pamela Noel.

04:51.050 --> 04:55.480
Master, if you have any food, 
might I borrow some from you?

04:55.480 --> 04:58.560
Huh? I do have some on me, but...

04:59.360 --> 05:00.570
Storage.

05:02.520 --> 05:03.480
Ow, hot.

05:03.930 --> 05:04.730
Here.

05:15.290 --> 05:17.210
So food is her bait.

05:17.640 --> 05:20.900
If you wake up, I'll feed you this skewer.

05:21.670 --> 05:23.910
I am feeling hungry.

05:23.910 --> 05:27.210
It's been 4,907 years 
since I ate a proper meal.

05:27.210 --> 05:28.550
Can I eat it?

05:29.250 --> 05:30.430
Go ahead.

05:34.160 --> 05:35.120
It's good.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.270
This is delicious.

05:36.270 --> 05:38.100
I'm glad to hear it.

05:44.070 --> 05:45.440
What's your name?

05:45.730 --> 05:47.490
Mochizuki Touya.

05:47.490 --> 05:50.680
I was just acknowledged as 
compatible by the Rampart.

05:50.680 --> 05:53.190
I was hoping you'd acknowledge
 me for the Tower, as well.

05:53.190 --> 05:57.550
There are conditions to determine 
if you're compatible for the Tower.

05:59.380 --> 06:01.230
What conditions?

06:01.230 --> 06:03.070
Enough food to fill my belly.

06:03.070 --> 06:04.750
A warm place to sleep.

06:04.750 --> 06:07.380
As long as I can have those, 
I have no complaints.

06:07.380 --> 06:10.760
You're honest about your desires.

06:12.550 --> 06:15.210
All right. I'll be sure to prepare those.

06:15.210 --> 06:18.400
Roger that. You've fulfilled the 
conditions, so I'll acknowledge you.

06:18.400 --> 06:22.650
As of this moment, Unit #25, 
code name "Pamela Noel,"

06:22.650 --> 06:24.490
will be transferred to your command.

06:24.490 --> 06:27.320
I'm counting on that food, Master.

06:27.320 --> 06:30.200
You're extra insistent on that food, huh?

06:40.850 --> 06:42.520
Registration complete.

06:42.520 --> 06:44.920
Genetic information recorded.

06:44.920 --> 06:48.590
Ownership of the Tower is 
now transferred to Master.

06:49.050 --> 06:51.900
Master, I demand more food.

06:51.900 --> 06:53.520
Jeez, come on...

06:53.520 --> 06:55.060
Storage.

06:56.520 --> 06:57.350
Here.

06:57.350 --> 06:58.600
Looks delicious.

06:59.120 --> 07:00.780
Sheesh...

07:12.130 --> 07:13.620
Registration complete.

07:13.620 --> 07:16.290
Genetic information recorded.

07:16.810 --> 07:20.370
Ownership of the Rampart 
is now transferred to Master.

07:20.370 --> 07:22.710
Th-That went on way too long!

07:22.710 --> 07:24.560
My apologies.

07:24.560 --> 07:27.450
It was my first time kissing a man,

07:27.450 --> 07:30.180
so I lost myself in it.

07:30.180 --> 07:31.720
A man?

07:31.720 --> 07:36.190
It was my duty to entertain 
the professor at night.

07:36.190 --> 07:40.590
If you wish, I could perform the same 
nightly duties for you, Master.

07:40.590 --> 07:41.390
As the penetrator—

07:44.090 --> 07:45.620
I'll explain.

07:45.620 --> 07:46.920
The Tower...

07:48.230 --> 07:49.240
Don't fall asleep.

07:49.240 --> 07:51.990
The Tower is the facility that 
serves as the heart of Babylon.

07:52.620 --> 07:55.880
It contains a massive reactor that draws 
magic particles from the air inside,

07:55.880 --> 07:58.830
amplifies it, and converts 
it into magical energy.

07:58.830 --> 08:01.700
The most impressive thing about the Tower

08:01.700 --> 08:05.220
is that it only needs occasional maintenance, 
so it's a piece of cake to manage.

08:05.590 --> 08:08.650
I can sleep and there won't be any issues.

08:09.730 --> 08:11.460
No, stop falling asleep.

08:13.270 --> 08:15.260
This is my Rampart.

08:15.730 --> 08:18.470
It's the central pillar of 
Babylon's defense systems,

08:18.470 --> 08:24.060
and it's able to deploy a defensive shield 
against both physical and magical attacks.

08:24.060 --> 08:25.230
I see.

08:25.530 --> 08:28.300
It sounds like the Tower 
will be able to speed up

08:28.300 --> 08:31.910
the mass production of Frame Gears 
and Ether Liquid refinement,

08:31.910 --> 08:35.570
and I bet we can count on rather sturdy 
defenses from the Rampart's shield.

08:37.520 --> 08:38.700
Don't underestimate me!

08:38.700 --> 08:40.580
I can still eat even more!

08:43.410 --> 08:50.250
So this is Yumina, Lucia, 
Yae, Elze, Linze, and Hilde.

08:50.250 --> 08:52.870
You're all Master's wives, then.

08:52.870 --> 08:54.400
Wives?

08:54.400 --> 08:57.090
Well, they will be eventually, but for now...

08:57.840 --> 08:59.650
Where are the other wives?

08:59.650 --> 09:00.560
Other wives?

09:00.560 --> 09:05.410
Oh, Sue-dono has returned 
to Belfast for a time.

09:05.410 --> 09:07.780
That accounts for seven. And the rest?

09:07.780 --> 09:08.650
<i>Master.</i>

09:08.650 --> 09:10.040
<i>What is it, Kohaku?</i>

09:10.040 --> 09:14.150
<i>You have an urgent letter 
from the Gate Mirror in Belfast.</i>

09:14.150 --> 09:15.240
Urgent?

09:16.080 --> 09:17.240
Gate.

09:18.520 --> 09:19.970
Here it is.

09:21.590 --> 09:23.920
Huh?! That's a big deal!

09:23.920 --> 09:25.920
What's the matter, Touya?

09:25.920 --> 09:27.040
She's giving birth!

09:27.040 --> 09:28.710
Giving birth?

09:28.710 --> 09:31.380
Wait, you mean my mother?!

09:32.300 --> 09:34.540
It says she just went into labor!

09:40.800 --> 09:42.020
Look at him!

09:42.020 --> 09:43.950
It's a healthy boy!

09:43.950 --> 09:46.260
The heir to my kingdom!

09:47.070 --> 09:48.620
Congratulations!

09:49.800 --> 09:52.270
He's so cute!

09:52.270 --> 09:57.480
Now, I would like you to be 
the one to name him, Touya.

09:57.480 --> 09:59.100
Huh?! Me?!

09:59.100 --> 10:01.610
Do you have any ideas for a good name?

10:01.610 --> 10:03.860
You're putting me on the spot...

10:03.860 --> 10:04.880
Um...

10:08.580 --> 10:11.270
How about Yamato?

10:11.270 --> 10:12.880
Yamato?

10:13.430 --> 10:16.510
Yamato Urnes Belfast.

10:16.510 --> 10:19.640
Yes, this boy shall be Yamato!

10:20.320 --> 10:24.660
Prince Yamato! Prince Yamato!

10:25.130 --> 10:27.550
Prince Yamato!

10:31.690 --> 10:32.840
What's wrong?

10:33.640 --> 10:36.190
Please don't startle him like that, Father.

10:36.190 --> 10:38.150
You should hurry to Queen Yuel.

10:38.150 --> 10:39.080
Right.

10:41.080 --> 10:43.440
I can understand that he's happy, but...

10:43.440 --> 10:45.240
He's too excited about it.

11:02.050 --> 11:05.510
Scrub-a-dub-dub.

11:12.490 --> 11:14.620
My uncle was excited,

11:14.620 --> 11:17.320
but the people of Belfast 
were overjoyed, too.

11:17.320 --> 11:20.110
Yes. When the birth of 
the prince was announced,

11:20.110 --> 11:22.660
we received congratulations 
from the other nations, too.

11:22.660 --> 11:25.490
We're holding a celebration 
in Brunhild as well, right?

11:25.490 --> 11:29.020
Their future queen's little brother 
was just born, after all.

11:29.020 --> 11:32.460
The people in the city 
are all ready to celebrate.

11:32.460 --> 11:35.380
I heard there were plans 
to set off fireworks.

11:35.380 --> 11:36.500
Fireworks?

11:36.500 --> 11:39.410
You haven't seen them yet, have you?

11:39.410 --> 11:42.270
They make big flowers bloom in the sky.

11:42.270 --> 11:43.510
They're pretty.

11:43.510 --> 11:46.810
Still, I'm glad he was born safely.

11:46.810 --> 11:50.440
I was a little touched by the whole affair.

11:50.850 --> 11:55.940
I suppose we'll all give birth 
to Touya's children one day.

11:55.940 --> 11:56.780
Huh?!

11:56.780 --> 12:01.450
R-Right. Well, one day. One day!

12:01.450 --> 12:03.330
One day...

12:08.460 --> 12:11.290
...and that's what they're 
having fun chatting about now!

12:13.120 --> 12:14.510
Children...

12:15.060 --> 12:19.090
I haven't even thought 
about having children yet.

12:19.090 --> 12:23.930
You have lots of wives, 
so you'll have lots of children, too.

12:23.930 --> 12:25.920
The professor mentioned it before.

12:25.920 --> 12:27.670
Professor Babylon?

12:27.670 --> 12:30.180
She knew I would have children, too?

12:34.900 --> 12:37.930
I saw it through the Clairvoyance Gem once!

12:37.930 --> 12:41.900
Each of your nine wives 
had a child of their own.

12:41.900 --> 12:44.230
You were a king who treasured his children.

12:44.230 --> 12:46.780
I had over nine children, huh?

12:47.330 --> 12:48.350
Wait...

12:48.350 --> 12:50.530
"Each of my nine wives"?

12:50.530 --> 12:51.580
What do you mean?!

12:51.580 --> 12:52.950
I had <i>nine</i> wives?!

12:53.280 --> 12:54.790
I haven't heard about this!

12:54.790 --> 12:56.220
No one said anything about it.

12:56.220 --> 12:59.170
We have told Leen about it.

12:59.170 --> 13:01.300
H-Hold on.

13:01.300 --> 13:03.280
I have seven at this point, right?

13:03.280 --> 13:05.530
Which means I'm going to have two more?

13:05.530 --> 13:07.140
What kind of future is this?!

13:08.840 --> 13:11.800
Have you discussed this 
with anyone other than Leen?

13:11.800 --> 13:13.080
I haven't.

13:13.080 --> 13:14.450
Then don't, ever!

13:14.450 --> 13:17.480
It's only likely to lead to even more harm.

13:18.920 --> 13:24.490
Can I take that to mean you'll be adding me 
to your list of remaining wife candidates?

13:24.490 --> 13:25.570
Huh?

13:25.570 --> 13:27.600
Is that outcome an option?

13:27.600 --> 13:30.660
If I marry Master, I can eat all I want!

13:30.660 --> 13:32.990
No, no, how do you get to that conclusion?!

13:32.990 --> 13:34.850
That will never be a possible outcome!

13:34.850 --> 13:36.560
Never say never.

13:36.560 --> 13:37.490
It's not happening!

13:37.490 --> 13:38.920
Just have to do the deed first.

13:38.920 --> 13:40.000
I said it's not happening!

13:40.000 --> 13:42.310
You haven't been listening to me, have you?!

13:42.310 --> 13:45.970
What haven't they been 
listening to you about?

13:58.440 --> 14:02.440
Stare...

14:02.440 --> 14:03.510
Huh?

14:03.510 --> 14:07.900
Uh, we weren't really 
talking about anything.

14:07.900 --> 14:14.620
Stare...

14:18.350 --> 14:20.920
Would you please tell us, Liora?

14:21.910 --> 14:24.430
We heard from the professor that Master—

14:24.430 --> 14:28.040
You don't have to say any more, Liora-san!

14:28.040 --> 14:33.110
I don't think it's right to blabbing 
about unconfirmed information!

14:33.110 --> 14:34.100
Yae.

14:34.100 --> 14:36.980
Yes, I do think that's quite wrong, okay?!

14:34.460 --> 14:35.270
Understood.

14:36.980 --> 14:38.900
Hey! What?!

14:38.900 --> 14:40.000
So?

14:40.350 --> 14:42.410
According to the future the professor saw,

14:42.410 --> 14:45.790
Master was married to nine wives.

14:45.790 --> 14:49.070
That is part of the reason Babylon 
was divided into nine parts.

14:49.560 --> 14:50.950
Nine?!

14:50.950 --> 14:53.370
My, my, how incredible.

14:53.370 --> 14:56.450
You mean there's still 
going to be even more?

14:56.450 --> 14:58.480
I don't even know what to say.

14:58.480 --> 15:00.330
I'm at a loss for words.

15:00.330 --> 15:00.910
Hey!

15:00.910 --> 15:04.180
Don't get that disappointed in me 
when I haven't even done it yet!

15:04.180 --> 15:05.230
Touya.

15:05.230 --> 15:06.310
Yes?!

15:06.310 --> 15:11.140
This isn't the place to discuss this. 
Why don't we return to the castle for now?

15:18.600 --> 15:20.100
What should we do, everyone?

15:20.100 --> 15:22.140
They said there will be nine!

15:23.060 --> 15:25.470
I feel incredibly left out.

15:25.470 --> 15:28.230
I wonder what sentence they'll settle on.

15:28.230 --> 15:29.470
Please don't call it a sentence.

15:29.470 --> 15:32.260
I hope your punishment isn't 
painful, Your Royal Highness.

15:32.260 --> 15:33.530
You too, Sakura?!

15:35.160 --> 15:37.980
You're so kind.

15:47.310 --> 15:48.960
We're already at this point,

15:48.960 --> 15:52.320
and nine isn't much difference from seven.

15:52.320 --> 15:58.970
We always thought that you should be 
surrounded by several wives anyway.

15:59.370 --> 16:01.320
Besides, it hasn't happened yet,

16:01.320 --> 16:05.030
so we decided that there's no 
point in chastising you for it.

16:06.230 --> 16:07.330
However...

16:07.330 --> 16:07.940
Huh?

16:07.940 --> 16:13.570
We do take issue with your attitude of 
not telling us and trying to keep it quiet.

16:13.570 --> 16:19.660
Keeping secrets is likely to cause a 
rift between married couples. Thus...

16:19.660 --> 16:20.930
Guilty.

16:20.930 --> 16:21.720
Guilty!

16:21.720 --> 16:23.040
Guilty.

16:23.040 --> 16:24.120
Guilty.

16:24.120 --> 16:25.210
Guilty!

16:25.210 --> 16:26.000
Guilty, I think.

16:26.000 --> 16:27.250
Guilty.

16:27.250 --> 16:30.260
H-Huh?!

16:32.480 --> 16:35.970
So... uh, what do you want me to do?

16:35.970 --> 16:39.430
Kiss each and every one of us, 
and we'll forgive you.

16:39.430 --> 16:40.300
Wha—

16:40.890 --> 16:44.970
Your actions have left us all anxious.

16:44.970 --> 16:49.610
So naturally, it's your duty to assuage 
those concerns with a display of affection.

16:49.610 --> 16:52.460
<i>T-Talk about a high bar...</i>

16:52.800 --> 16:55.700
<i>I've already done it with 
Yumina and Linze, but...</i>

16:57.170 --> 16:59.370
<i>Honestly, this is really embarrassing.</i>

16:59.800 --> 17:03.250
<i>I'd like to just gloss over
it and put it off, but...</i>

17:04.540 --> 17:07.680
Surely you aren't thinking
of running away, right?

17:08.130 --> 17:10.690
If you've been judged guilty,

17:10.690 --> 17:12.460
you should atone for your crimes.

17:18.070 --> 17:20.510
R-Right, we have the celebration first!

17:20.920 --> 17:24.230
We need to prepare for the celebration 
of Prince Yamato's birth!

17:24.600 --> 17:28.540
So I'll fulfill that obligation afterward!

17:30.830 --> 17:32.280
Very well.

17:32.640 --> 17:34.500
Thanks!

17:34.500 --> 17:37.740
He thinks he's escaped danger for now,

17:37.740 --> 17:41.840
but it will only grow even 
more difficult as time passes.

17:41.840 --> 17:44.800
Yeah. Good luck, Your Royal Highness.

17:51.410 --> 17:53.440
How beautiful!

18:00.550 --> 18:01.700
Hup!

18:26.060 --> 18:30.150
You look very happy, Touya.

18:30.650 --> 18:31.420
Yeah.

18:31.970 --> 18:35.430
When I first saw how the king reacted 
when Prince Yamato was born,

18:35.430 --> 18:41.340
I was shocked to see how easily parents fall
head over heels when their child is born.

18:41.700 --> 18:46.220
Though now I understand that's 
the joy of their family growing.

18:48.610 --> 18:51.790
I don't have any children yet,

18:51.790 --> 18:53.110
but I have all of you.

18:56.450 --> 18:57.960
And I have this country.

18:59.810 --> 19:00.760
So...

19:04.430 --> 19:06.290
No matter what happens,

19:06.600 --> 19:09.660
I want to keep all the people 
precious to me safe,

19:10.460 --> 19:12.630
and I want to live with you all forever.

19:14.930 --> 19:16.340
Touya...

19:21.380 --> 19:24.010
I think I was a little too forward earlier.

19:25.310 --> 19:27.470
N-Not fair.

19:27.470 --> 19:29.310
M-Me, too!

19:32.330 --> 19:34.230
What are you doing over here in secret?

19:34.230 --> 19:37.700
You'd better fulfill your duty as husband 
and show some affection!

19:37.700 --> 19:40.020
H-Huh? Right now?

19:40.020 --> 19:40.950
Right now!

19:47.130 --> 19:48.120
On my cheek?

19:48.830 --> 19:51.470
I-I'm next.

19:51.790 --> 19:54.680
Uh, then...

19:54.680 --> 19:55.590
Huh?!

19:55.590 --> 19:57.420
I-I-I-I-I'm sorry!

19:57.420 --> 19:59.920
I'm too embarrassed!

19:59.920 --> 20:01.110
Huh?

20:01.110 --> 20:05.060
By the way, Hilde was so nervous, 
she already passed out.

20:05.060 --> 20:05.890
Huh?!

20:05.890 --> 20:07.990
K-Kiss...

20:10.160 --> 20:13.270
S-So next would be me.

20:27.870 --> 20:28.790
No!

20:28.870 --> 20:30.660
Why?!

20:32.600 --> 20:34.060
Are you okay?

20:46.970 --> 20:50.000
Again, why?!

21:12.490 --> 21:16.200
Master, the last of the fireworks are up next.

21:18.210 --> 21:20.090
Go!

21:32.520 --> 21:34.440
Nine, huh?

21:40.350 --> 21:41.690
We finished it!

21:42.920 --> 21:47.080
Oh? I found that in the Hangar the other day.

21:47.080 --> 21:47.840
Yes.

21:48.550 --> 21:50.510
It's the Clairvoyance Gem.

21:50.510 --> 21:53.870
Talking about it made me want to look again.

21:53.870 --> 21:56.510
We might be able to see Master's future.

21:56.510 --> 21:58.080
I want to see, too.

21:58.080 --> 21:59.090
Me, too.

21:59.090 --> 22:01.540
Me, too.

21:59.520 --> 22:01.540
I'm so curious.

22:30.810 --> 22:33.830
Every day is bittersweet

22:33.830 --> 22:36.240
(Bubbly bubbly)

22:36.240 --> 22:41.710
I might still blush when 
your eyes are close up

22:42.900 --> 22:47.320
Our love affair goes around with 
the 1, 2, 3 beat of I, My, Me, Mine

22:47.320 --> 22:50.190
But "Look solely at me"

22:50.560 --> 22:56.320
Is something I can't say; 
I want you to notice my jealousy

22:57.600 --> 23:00.250
My hero glimpsed through a lens

23:00.250 --> 23:04.050
I want you to take everything, 
even your flawed kindness

23:04.050 --> 23:06.760
And fill me up with goodness even more

23:06.760 --> 23:09.430
(even more)

23:09.430 --> 23:12.270
Until I burst

23:12.270 --> 23:17.310
My heart races and aches deep 
within because I love you

23:17.310 --> 23:22.760
My love is rapidly rising, 
but, but, but, but

23:22.760 --> 23:26.550
I can't help that we're in another world

23:26.550 --> 23:31.640
Let's sing about this joyous occasion 
illuminated by the brilliant sun!

23:31.640 --> 23:33.670
"Together forever!"

23:33.670 --> 23:37.960
I may not be much, but I want you 
to hug me from time to time,

23:37.960 --> 23:39.560
And if you're far away, that's okey-dokey

23:39.560 --> 23:42.050
We'll live happily ever after!
